<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5663] ODBC: Few consecutive inserts lead to exception</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5663</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Exception: (&apos;HY010&apos;, &apos;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;HY010&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Query is not prepared. (0) (SQLExecDirectW)&apos;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer in python:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pyodbc
cnxn = pyodbc.connect(DRIVER=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;{Apache Ignite}&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, ADDRESS=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;localhost:10800&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,CACHE=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Person&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, autocommit=True)
cursor = cnxn.cursor()
select_string= &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;INSERT INTO Person(_key, id, firstName, lastName, salary) VALUES (?, ? , &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;abcd&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;dhsagd&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, 1000)&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
id_list = (1,1)
id_list2 = (2,2)
cursor.execute(select_string, id_list) 
cursor.execute(select_string, id_list2) 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, the same behavior with executemany.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
